WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.700
Examples of questions
(without warning signs)

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.200
“Has someone hurt you?”

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.000
“Has someone made you suffer?”

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.600
“Have you experienced violence?”

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.600
“Has anyone ever done or made you do things
that made you uncomfortable?”

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.000
“How are things going at your club?”

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.200
“You know… Competing in elite sport increases
the risk of experiencing violence.
Has that ever happened to you?”
